ter so much  time i really hope it holds up like it  is occasionally laugh out loud funny not  all the time um it's mostly like  cute kind of funny like very pleasant  uh sense of humor but yeah the humor  still holds up it it's really well  written it's cheeky um and it's not  you know  the next question directly after this  was would it be considered a children's  game or does it have more dark adult  humor um  it  i don't even know how we even really  quantify what a children's game is  anymore but yeah it has tons of dark  adult humor it's funny in a way that is  wholesome but not like too wholesome you  know it's not not every character is  nice not every character is smart some  of them are goofy and ugly and dorky and  it really does know what it is and what  its tone is and it really owns that and  i really uh appreciate that about it oh  by the way  he's right here  uh little um boss travel hubs they will  let you kind of swap between areas in  this this main central hub so that you  don't have to  levitate  your whole way there though you know why  would you want to do anything else  that's my question why would you not  want to roll on your sweet levitation  ball khalil said does it seem like it  has a lot of replay value  yeah some cool things about that when  you finish the game you can go back  through all of the levels and uh  actually when you finish the game they  will be a little bit different which is  cool there is a post game  so  not only are the levels uh definitely  replayable you're going to want to go  get all your figments you're going to  want to go get all your bag tags um  the million other  psychology related puns that are worked  into this game are all there but uh yeah  there is a  postgame  state  that adds a little bit more content and  some changes to the content that is  already there michael donahue uh said is  the audio good um  yes  the score is brilliant the music has me  legitimately smiling it is it is so  wonderful and and obviously diff is  depending on where you are and what  you're doing but uh  yeah the the music's fantastic i mean  the audio design in general i have  absolutely no complaints about it's it's  great  but uh i did definitely want to shout  out the music i actually don't know who  composed it but whoever did did a really  really good job it's jazzy it's funky  it's stylish  and again really consistent with the  tone of the game and i you know i think  they did a very very good job of just  capturing whatever this essence of  psychonauts is top to bottom  every part of the game it's really  really impressive that is not easy to do  especially when the first game came out  so long ago vast majority of the  questions are all is it good do you like  it is it fun uh yes i do think this game  is good um i have mentioned the couple  of things i don't love about it the the  uh very frequent cutscenes being the  main one and i'm not a huge fan of the  collect-a-thon  uh theme in general but otherwise uh i  do think the game is really wonderful i  think a lot of people are gonna have a  really good time with it  and um yeah i wanted to limit to like i  said showing you guys this area so that  i'm not spoiling any of the best parts  of the game which are everyone's mind  palaces um they're so varied and so much  smarter than i expected them to be but  that is pretty much it if anyone has any  more questions uh before you all get to  play the game tomorrow please do let me  know i'm happy to answer them but  otherwise that is it for me today  everyone i will see you guys next time
 

